# Flux Flutter Pipeline

This project uses a **mandatory multi-agent pipeline** for feature development.

## Pipeline (never skip)

1. `flutter-task-writer` — technical task only, no code
2. `flutter-implementation` — code from task only
3. `flutter-code-review` — `APPROVED` or `CHANGES_REQUIRED` only
4. `flutter-qa-test` — `PASSED` or `FAILED`; on fail → back to implementation

Orchestrate with `flutter-pipeline-orchestrator` or `/flux` workflow.

